    "b-00-overview-prompt-structure-begins-2": {
      "id": "b-00-overview-prompt-structure-begins-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Prompt structure begins with placement. Behavior, reusable reference material,\nand live session data have different lifecycles, so combining them makes prompts\nharder to change and gives the model a less reliable picture of its work. These\npages define where each kind of material belongs and how the system-prompt\nportion should be shaped. They are the model-facing conventions of the system\ndesign: what a rendered prompt looks like, not how the system produces it."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
